WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.750
A plausible calculation does not certify a vehicle for road use.

2
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:37.500
Requirements depend on jurisdiction, vehicle type, modification, and use.

3
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:56.250
NHTSA and UNECE are examples of official frameworks, not universal rules.

4
00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:15.000
Check current local authority requirements; this lesson makes no legal determination.
